{"version":1,"content":"<p>開源辦公套件LibreOffice的維護方「文檔基金會」（The Document Foundation，簡稱TDF）宣佈，對該項目開發過程中使用大語言模型（LLM）及AI輔助編程的做法實施更嚴格的政策。新規要求貢獻者在使用AI工具前獲得許可、在提交記錄中披露相關使用情況，並禁止將LLM用於撰寫提交説明、代碼注釋、缺陷報告及與他人溝通的內容。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587858.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.807474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:27:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_hash":"f8fffd33c33dcab111524f17bbf61ddddda5b0633ed36099b8db7696be1e2611","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}